 verify read the result as they read the loose refs it replaced.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ProjectSidewalk/SidewalkWebpage","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-28T19:50:02Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"0380ebaa130636ab5d0f4245f8aa2091f4a160f9","github_link":"https://github.com/ProjectSidewalk/SidewalkWebpage/commit/0380ebaa130636ab5d0f4245f8aa2091f4a160f9","commit_subject":"Show the not-allowed cursor on the remaining switched-off controls (#5528)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"viamrobotics/rdk","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-28T19:49:43Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"5250e853e4da8eb361713120de2502a43d4713b8","github_link":"https://github.com/viamrobotics/rdk/commit/5250e853e4da8eb361713120de2502a43d4713b8","commit_subject":"RSDK-14598 Stop the CLI's idle app connections from pinging themselves into an ENHANCE_YOUR_CALM GoAway (#6531)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ror-community/ror-api","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-28T19:49:43Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"7fe443f2b657d1a67d71c1c8f337a6902fcff798","github_link":"https://github.com/ror-community/ror-api/commit/7fe443f2b657d1a67d71c1c8f337a6902fcff798","commit_subject":"Throttle anonymous client registration at 5/hour (#576)","ai_tool":"Cursor"},{"repo_name":"abrignoni/VLEAPP","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-28T19:49:38Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"a9c7e2f73fecd9b2d7536e0dbf5871940c5a901c","github_link":"https://github.com/abrignoni/VLEAPP/commit/a9c7e2f73fecd9b2d7536e0dbf5871940c5a901c","commit_subject":"Record a media item's evidence path, not the examiner's staged path","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"abrignoni/ALEAPP","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-28T19:49:37Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"0ec45bd6179050a2b0cb5cc6fad62e2b5e64a6ac","github_link":"https://github.com/abrignoni/ALEAPP/commit/0ec45bd6179050a2b0cb5cc6fad62e2b5e64a6ac","commit_subject":"Record a media item's evidence path, not the examiner's staged path","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"abrignoni/RLEAPP","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-28T19